                "event": "Flash Flood Warning",
                "sender": "w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov",
                "senderName": "NWS Fort Worth TX",
                "headline": "Flash Flood Warning issued October 3 at 3:53PM CDT until October 3 at 6:00PM CDT by NWS Fort Worth TX",
                "description": "FFWFWD\n\nThe National Weather Service in Fort Worth has extended the\n\n* Flash Flood Warning for...\nCentral Henderson County in central Texas...\n\n* Until 600 PM CDT.\n\n* At 353 PM CDT, thunderstorms continue producing heavy rain in\nAthens. Numerous reports and videos have been received of flooded\nand impassible roadways across the area. Between 3 and 5 inches of\nrain have fallen. The expected rainfall rate is 1 to 2 inches in 1\nhour. Additional rainfall amounts of 1 to 3 inches are possible in\nthe warned area. Flash flooding is already occurring.\n\nHAZARD...Life threatening flash flooding. Thunderstorms producing\nflash flooding.\n\nSOURCE...Public reported.\n\nIMPACT...Life threatening flash flooding of creeks and streams,\nurban areas, highways, streets and underpasses.\n\n* Some locations that will experience flash flooding include...\nAthens and Crescent Heights.",
                "instruction": "Turn around, don't drown when encountering flooded roads. Most flood\ndeaths occur in vehicles.\n\nBe aware of your surroundings and do not drive on flooded roads.",
                "response": "Avoid",
                "note": null,
                "parameters": {
                    "AWIPSidentifier": [
                        "FFWFWD"
                    ],
                    "WMOidentifier": [
                        "WGUS54 KFWD 032053"
                    ],
                    "flashFloodDetection": [
                        "OBSERVED"
                    ],
                    "flashFloodDamageThreat": [
                        "CONSIDERABLE"
                    ],
                    "BLOCKCHANNEL": [
                        "EAS",
                        "NWEM"
                    ],
                    "EAS-ORG": [
                        "WXR"
                    ],
                    "VTEC": [
                        "/O.EXT.KFWD.FF.W.0094.000000T0000Z-261003T2300Z/"
                    ],
                    "eventEndingTime": [
                        "2026-10-03T18:00:00-05:00"
                    ],
                    "WEAHandling": [
                        "Imminent Threat"
                    ],
                    "CMAMtext": [
                        "NWS: FLASH FLOOD WARNING this area til 6:00 PM CDT. Avoid flooded areas."
                    ],
                    "CMAMlongtext": [
                        "National Weather Service: A FLASH FLOOD WARNING is in effect for this area until 6:00 PM CDT. This is a dangerous and life-threatening situation. Do not attempt to travel unless you are fleeing an area subject to flooding or under an evacuation order."
                    ]
